      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a class="button button--gold" href="/docs/get-started/">Build your first conversational application <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="button button--ghost" href="#shift">See how it replaces a web workflow</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero__caption"><strong>The flow is the application. The conversation is the UI. PicoFlow is the runtime.</strong></p>
    </div>
